| File | Path |
|------|------|
| HeadlessApplication.class | `/root/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/com.badlogicgames.gdx/gdx-backend-headless/1.14.2/a3001337b30a1aa7c4f9b5d85ae74cf7f7e7780c/gdx-backend-headless-1.14.2.jar` |
| MockGraphics.class | Same JAR, `com/badlogic/gdx/backends/headless/mock/graphics/MockGraphics.class` |
| HeadlessNativesLoader.class | Same JAR, `com/badlogic/gdx/backends/headless/HeadlessNativesLoader.class` |
